flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9814594Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9815032Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9815212Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9815401Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9816658Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9817030Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9817294Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9817818Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9818123Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9818788Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9819518Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9820052Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9820364Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9820513Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9820711Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9820921Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9821106Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9821424Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9821554Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9821650Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9821804Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T16:12:38.9822059Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
